title: Boss_Fight
---
Vallulah: Well well, isn’t it the famous Pidgeon A. Holliday?

Pigeon: Well, yer flatterin’ me! I wouldn’t say famous-

Vallulah: My Vinny’s told me all about you, you’re entering a dangerous game, you know

Vallulah: To be COWBOY SUPREME isn't an easy task, and I'm the only one who can handle it!

Vinny: Dat's right, Vallulah's da best!

Vallulah: So stand down! There's not enough fame for the both of us!

Pigeon: I just want yer beaks

Vallulah: Doesn’t everyone? We’re the hottest couple in the west, isn’t that right, Vinny?

Vinny: Yes Ma’am!

Vallulah: So prepare to perish!

Vinny: Yeah!

Vallulah: If you want our beaks, you’ll have to die like everyone else!
===
